OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FIn Steve Reich's 90th birthday
OL,7,     Fyear, a concert from Madrid
OL,8,     Ffeatures 'Music for Pieces of
OL,9,     FWood', the Mallet Quartet and his
OL,10,     Fepic work 'Drumming'.
OL,11,G0630 Breakfast
OL,12,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,16,     FTom Service talks to Last Night of
OL,17,     Fthe Proms conductor Sakari Oramo
OL,18,     Fabout his musical journey, and
OL,19,     Fcomposer Julian Nott talks about
OL,20,     Fcreating the iconic theme to
OL,21,     FWallace & Gromit.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/5
