OL,5,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,6,     FEdith Bowman presents a mix of
OL,7,     Fmovie music. This week, composer
OL,8,     Fand musician Anne Dudley joins to
OL,9,     Fdiscuss Thomas Newman's score to
OL,10,     F'Road to Perdition' in
OL,11,     F'Harmonising Hollywood'.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,14,     FAmerican cellist and composer
OL,15,     FClarice Jensen for a listening
OL,16,     Fparty, including music by Ligeti,
OL,17,     FStravinsky and Bill Callahan.
