OL,5,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,6,     FJuan Diego Florez stars as Tonio
OL,7,     Fin Donizetti's comic masterpiece
OL,8,     Ffrom The Royal Opera, where a
OL,9,     Fspirited young woman raised by a
OL,10,     Fregiment of soldiers chooses
OL,11,     Fbetween love and duty.
OL,12,G2130 Music Planet
OL,13,     FKathryn Tickell presents global
OL,14,     Ffolk and roots-based music, and
OL,15,     FIrish singer and
OL,16,     Fmulti-instrumentalist Radie Peat
OL,17,     Fshares her Return Journey
OL,18,     Fselections.
OL,19,G2230 New Music Show
OL,20,     FTom Service with music by Stefano
OL,21,     FGervasoni, Laurence Osborn and
OL,22,     FPhyllis Chen.
